{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は「帝一の國」を観に行ってきました！\nさゆにゃんとひなちまが演じる美美子ちゃん可愛いっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄い面白かったし、続きが気になってしまったよ！もう一回見たい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから観に行かれる方は、是非とも楽しんで！\n二人とも、舞台頑張ってね(⌒▽⌒)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこの前は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"氣志團現象2014 「極東ロックンロール・ハイスクール 第弐章」\n#34 乃木坂46 vs 氣志團 〜学生服反逆同盟〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"氣志團の皆さんが、綿あめ機やソフトクリーム機など用意して下さって、みんなで作って食べたりしたよ( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは、ファミコンやツイスターもやった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いざ、さゆりんと勝負！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2014/04/18/2907658/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2014/04/18/2907658/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"必死で遊ぶ21歳笑 楽しかった♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後には、氣志團の皆さんと会いたかったかもしれない、One Night Carnivalをコラボさせて頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リハの時から皆さん本当に優しくて、優しくて...ライブもたくさん汗かいて燃え尽きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また呼んで頂けるように私達も力をつけたいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2014/04/18/2907658/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Tシャツ！これみんなの絵が描かれてるんだけど、これがめっちゃ似てるんです！\n嬉しい！可愛い！宝物！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏がブログで、黒石さんに自転車の乗り方教えてもらおうかな！って書いてた(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいよぉ〜〜〜？♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乗れるまで教えてあ・げ・る（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2014/04/18/2907658/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肩出しは、おしゃれです。\nby白石"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん。"}],"source":"archive"}